<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 330 mln rand S.African bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 330 mln rand S.African bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers 330.49 million rand's worth of bonds on Monday after buying 285.38 million rand's worth on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
